Benchmark data
--------------
`vulcan/data/sol_execbench_b200_flashinfer.json` is collected from the public
SOL-ExecBench API by `vulcan/scripts/fetch_board.py` and contains only published
leaderboard figures (per-workload latencies and per-kernel scores).

